{
 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, its regular play of 2-3 minutes: the launcher, Load ROM",
  "on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind the launcher is done (Firefox builds none there, and its",
  "line saying so is the one waited for), Start Game, then the Controller Pak screen's Create New Game with A (X), and",
  "A through the logos, the intro, the title and the menus' defaults, as a player does: One Player, Single Race, Full",
  "Grid, Easy, the first car, Automatic, Coventry Cove. A shot every few presses catches the menus. The race is a need",
  "that the game is racing (gGameSettings.currentGameState 5, tools/game_state.js), and it is driven 65 s of the race's",
  "own clock (0x8002CC78, seconds, its flyover and countdown included), with shots about 15, 40 and 65 s in: the game's",
  "steer assist on (gGameSettings.dbgSteerAssist), the gas (A) held from 4 s, and every 5 s a check that backs the car",
  "out of a fence or a rock face it has stopped against (stuck(), below 8 miles an hour): the Z trigger (left Shift),",
  "which puts the car in reverse while it is held, then 0.8 s forward with the stick one way, the next time the other;",
  "a check that finds the car moving presses nothing. The car still leaves the road now and then, and the race ends",
  "before the game disqualifies a car that has driven the wrong way too long. tools/shader_plan.json's races are the",
  "same drive."
 ],
